---
// components
import Section from "../../elements/Section.astro";
import Text from "../../elements/Text.astro";
---

<Section 
    aria-label="Biography"
    title="Biography"
    titleHeading="Ordinary Student, Football Enthusiast, Gamer, Random Guy"
>
    <Text variant={'normal'} class="text-base-400">Hello everyone! My name is Prama Hardi Tonapa, but you can call me Rama. I'm a first-year Statistics student at the Faculty of Mathematics and Natural Sciences, Cenderawasih University. Just an ordinary student trying to enjoy the journey, learn new things, and figure out what the future has in store for me.</Text>
    <Text variant={'normal'} class="text-base-400">Outside academics, I'm a football enthusiast who enjoys following the game, exploring different clubs, and discussing football-related stuff. I'm also a gamer who loves spending time playing games, exploring different worlds, and occasionally getting competitive. And well, I'm just a random person with random interests, random thoughts, and sometimes random activities that even I can't explain.</Text>
    <Text variant={'normal'} class="text-base-400">When it comes to academics and technology, I enjoy numbers, mathematics, and exploring the world of coding. I'm also curious about artificial intelligence, data, and how technology might shape the future. I don't have everything figured out yet, but that's part of the fun. I'm simply here to learn, explore, make connections, enjoy my interests, and see where this journey takes me.</Text>

</Section>